Data
    The HNL and ttbar samples (X. Ju, "Large Radius Tracking Events in pp collisions with a Generic detector",
    doi:10.5281/zenodo.6812533) and the TrackML datasets (doi:10.5281/zenodo.4730157 and the Kaggle accuracy phase)
    are not included; splits/ lists the event identifiers used.
